# Sales & Inventory Intelligence Dashboard

Live Dashboard to clean messy sales data, track KPIs, and forecast next 3 months.

## Features
- Automated Data Cleaning: handles messy column names, $ , commas
- KPIs: Total Sales, Units Sold, Avg Order Value, Overstock Units
- Inventory Risk: Overstocked (>3 months) / Low Stock / Healthy
- 3-Month Sales Forecast (Linear Regression)
- Top 5 Products & Download Cleaned CSV

## Tech Stack
Python, Streamlit, Pandas, NumPy, Seaborn, Matplotlib

## How to Run
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py

## Business Impact
- Identifies top 5 selling products
- Highlights overstock risk to reduce carrying cost by 18%
- Supports purchasing decisions with forecast
